    "key": "graphs.sketching.card.sketch",
    "cardType": "DEFINITION",
    "front": "What must a **sketch** of a graph show?",
    "back": "The correct shape and labelled key features: intercepts, roots, turning points, asymptotes. It need not be to scale.",
